* AI inference KV-cache vdbench v1 - run only
* Runs Zipfian-skewed KV-cache prefill, decode, and prefix-reuse phases.
* This file intentionally contains no Vdbench formatting RD.
* KV rank weights aggregate 4MiB-object Zipf(alpha=0.99) into eight equal-capacity ranks:
* 79/7/4/3/2/2/2/1.
* Transfer sizes and thread counts are execution parameters, not claimed as paper constants.

data_errors=1
create_anchors=yes
messagescan=no

hd=default,vdbench=@VDBENCH_HOME@,user=@REMOTE_USER@,shell=ssh
hd=hd1,system=@HOST1@

fsd=default,depth=1,width=1,shared=yes,openflags=o_direct
fsd=fsd_kv_active_rank_01,anchor=@ANCHOR@/kv_active_rank_01,files=5,size=1g
